l8589976154: 610 l8589976153 l8589976131 # Has value (Has a (EITE Record Documents (ERD), Description), "Special-purpose EITE format in Structured mode intended for structured record storage (representing a subset of EITE Language documents). Listed in the May 2019 EITE specification (with an earlier unedited reference to EMR; acronym expansion of EMR unattested) as not yet defined.")
l8589976155: 584 f916 574 # Has a (EITE Record Documents (ERD), Programmatic identifier)
l8589976156: 610 l8589976155 l8589976132 # Has value (Has a (EITE Record Documents (ERD), Programmatic identifier), "Erd")
