l8589976158: 610 l8589976157 l8589976133 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format, Canonical name), "Ember Document Format")
l8589976159: 584 f917 573 # Has a (Ember Document Format, Description)
l8589976160: 610 l8589976159 l8589976134 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format, Description), "Binary container format family from Ember (2015; magic prefix \\x89EDFe\\r\\n\\x1a) wrapping a payload with a NUL-terminated, pipe-delimited ASCII metadata and checksum header. In Ember 1.0.51, edf_latest was an alias of edf_1_0_44.")
l8589976161: 584 f917 574 # Has a (Ember Document Format, Programmatic identifier)
l8589976162: 610 l8589976161 l8589976135 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format, Programmatic identifier), "Edf")
l8589976163: 584 f918 572 # Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.43, Canonical name)
l8589976164: 610 l8589976163 l8589976136 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.43, Canonical name), "Ember Document Format 1.0.43")
l8589976165: 584 f918 573 # Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.43, Description)
l8589976166: 610 l8589976165 l8589976137 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.43, Description), "Incompatible legacy binary format specified in Ember 1.0.43 (magic \\x89EDFe\\r\\n\\x1a\\n\\xfe\\xff). Follows the 11-byte magic with a pipe-delimited ASCII metadata header containing a URL field, 972-byte space-padded Format version field, content MD5/SHA-1/SHA-512 hex digests, 566-byte space-padded PUAI Author Identifier, header MD5/SHA-1/SHA-512 hex digests, and NUL (0x00), followed by the payload bytes. Only a standalone writer helper (commented out in convert() and with no reader) survived in Ember 1.0.51.")
l8589976167: 584 f918 574 # Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.43, Programmatic identifier)
l8589976168: 610 l8589976167 l8589976138 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.43, Programmatic identifier), "Edf_1_0_43")
l8589976169: 584 f919 572 # Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.44, Canonical name)
l8589976170: 610 l8589976169 l8589976139 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.44, Canonical name), "Ember Document Format 1.0.44")
l8589976171: 584 f919 573 # Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.44, Description)
l8589976172: 610 l8589976171 l8589976140 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.44, Description), "Binary format specified in Ember 1.0.44 (magic \\x89EDFe\\r\\n\\x1a\\xfe\\xff\\n; aliased as edf_latest in Ember 1.0.51). Follows the 11-byte magic with a pipe-delimited ASCII metadata header containing a URL field, 972-byte space-padded Format version (\"1_0_44\"), content MD5/SHA-1/SHA-512 hex digests, 567-byte space-padded PUAI Author Identifier, 1517-byte space-padded Creation metadata (Creation time and Creation location), 501-byte space-padded Comments, header MD5/SHA-1/SHA-512 hex digests, and NUL (0x00), followed by the payload bytes. Only a standalone writer helper (commented out in convert() and with no reader) survived in Ember 1.0.51.")
l8589976173: 584 f919 574 # Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.44, Programmatic identifier)
l8589976174: 610 l8589976173 l8589976141 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format 1.0.44, Programmatic identifier), "Edf_1_0_44")
