l8589976177: 584 f920 573 # Has a (Ember Document Format ASCII Dc List, Description)
l8589976178: 610 l8589976177 l8589976143 # Has value (Has a (Ember Document Format ASCII Dc List, Description), "Ember 1.0.51 (2015) native ASCII pivot format (\"EDF Dc List\", format code dc, *.edc) storing comma-separated decimal short Dc IDs bounded by Dc 235 at the start and Dc 236 at the end (e.g., 235,...,236).")
